ATTRIBUTION / 致谢

This project builds on protocol reverse-engineering work published by others:

* Esther7314/cachito-ble-control — https://github.com/Esther7314/cachito-ble-control
  The most complete public description of the BLE advertising protocol used by this
  device family: frame layout, checksum, command set, level formulas, latch behaviour,
  and byte-level samples. This project's encoder (server/shikong_codec.py and
  android/.../ShikongProtocol.kt) follows that description.

* yoruuuchan/cachito-ble-mcp-relay — https://github.com/yoruuuchan/cachito-ble-mcp-relay
  MIT licensed. The Android module's Gradle skeleton, Gradle wrapper, and the
  BLE startAdvertising call pattern (AdvertiseSettings / AdvertiseData /
  AdvertiseCallback) are derived from it. The protocol, scheduler, foreground
  service, WebSocket layer and UI were rewritten for a different device.

* Moonriseandset/cachito-shikong-mcp — https://github.com/Moonriseandset/cachito-shikong-mcp
  Independent confirmation of the same protocol on macOS, and the observation that
  the vendor's built-in patterns are intensity envelopes rather than opcodes.

Neither this project nor the works above are affiliated with, endorsed by, or
supported by the device manufacturer.
